    <durationDays>1</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>2</stackLimit>
    <stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>1</stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>
    <stages><li><label>spring in the air</label><description>The first green shoots are coming up through the mud. We stood in the sun and looked at them.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect><baseOpinionOffset>2</baseOpinionOffset></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><joy>0.06</joy><joyKind>Meditative</joyKind><felt>2</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Moment_LiftedSpirits</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilSocial</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>1</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>2</stackLimit>
    <stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>1</stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>
    <stages><li><label>lifted someone's spirits</label><description>They were having a bad day. I got a smile out of them before I left.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect><baseOpinionOffset>2</baseOpinionOffset></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>1</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Moment_CheeredUp</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilSocial</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>1.5</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>2</stackLimit>
    <stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>1</stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>
    <stages><li><label>someone cheered me up</label><description>I was low today. They noticed, and stayed close until it passed.</description><baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect><baseOpinionOffset>8</baseOpinionOffset></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Moment_ToldMyStory</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilSocial</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>2</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>2</stackLimit>
    <stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>1</stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>
    <stages><li><label>told someone where I came from</label><description>I'm still new here, but they wanted to hear where I came from, and listened to all of it.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect><baseOpinionOffset>4</baseOpinionOffset></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>2</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Moment_HeardTheirStory</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilSocial</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>2</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>2</stackLimit>
    <stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>1</stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>
    <stages><li><label>heard where they came from</label><description>I know now where they grew up, and what they miss most about it.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect><baseOpinionOffset>3</baseOpinionOffset></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>1</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Moment_SharedJoke</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilSocial</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>0.5</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>2</stackLimit>
    <stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>1</stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>
    <stages><li><label>a joke at work</label><description>We traded jokes over the work until one of us had to stop and lean on the wall.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect><baseOpinionOffset>3</baseOpinionOffset></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><joy>0.05</joy><felt>1</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Moment_GrumbledTogether</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilSocial</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>0.5</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>2</stackLimit>
    <stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>1</stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>
    <stages><li><label>grumbled about the weather</label><description>We stood about complaining about the weather, and agreed on every word.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect><baseOpinionOffset>2</baseOpinionOffset></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>1</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Moment_RoundPlanned</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilSocial</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>0.5</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>2</stackLimit>
    <stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>1</stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>
    <stages><li><label>a drink to look forward to</label><description>We've a drink planned for after work. The afternoon can't go fast enough.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect><baseOpinionOffset>3</baseOpinionOffset></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>1</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- ===================== Bonds ===================== -->

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Moment_FoughtTogether</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilSocial</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>2</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>2</stackLimit>
    <stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>1</stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>
    <stages><li><label>remembered the fight together</label><description>We went over the fight moment by moment. They were there, so I didn't have to explain any of it.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect><baseOpinionOffset>6</baseOpinionOffset></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><feelings><li>Fellowship</li></feelings><felt>3</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Moment_LessonsPayOff</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilSocial</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>2</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>2</stackLimit>
    <stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>1</stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>
    <stages><li><label>the lessons are paying off</label><description>Day after day at these lessons, and today it finally showed. Neither of us had to say anything twice.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect><baseOpinionOffset>5</baseOpinionOffset></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><skillFrom>theirs</skillFrom><xp>200</xp><felt>2</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Moment_GotAJabIn</defName>
    <durationDays>0.5</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>got a good jab in</label><description>I got a good jab in at my rival. I saw the look on their face.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><journal>true</journal><felt>1</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Moment_RivalJabbed</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilSocial</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>1</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>2</stackLimit>
    <stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>1</stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>
    <stages><li><label>my rival's little jab</label><description>My rival had something snide to say, as usual. I'll think of the perfect answer tonight, too late.</description><baseMoodEffect>-1</baseMoodEffect><baseOpinionOffset>-3</baseOpinionOffset></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Moment_NotFacingItAlone</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilSocial</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>2</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>2</stackLimit>
    <stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>1</stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>
    <stages><li><label>they stood by me</label><description>The one who hurt me is still out there, but I'm not facing it alone.</description><baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect><baseOpinionOffset>8</baseOpinionOffset></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Council_Moment_TrustedWithIt</defName>
    <thoughtClass>ColonyCouncil.Thought_CouncilSocial</thoughtClass>
    <durationDays>2</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>2</stackLimit>
    <stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>1</stackLimitForSameOtherPawn>
    <stages><li><label>they trusted me with it</label><description>They told me what still keeps them up at night. Whoever comes for them next will have to get past me.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect><baseOpinionOffset>4</baseOpinionOffset></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>1</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Moment_ShowedOffAnimal</defName>
    <durationDays>1</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>bragged about my animal</label><description>I showed off my animal. It's the best animal on the Rim, and now the others know it.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><joy>0.05</joy><felt>2</felt></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

